account Equity:ShareCapital:ClassA:CEO
account Equity:ShareCapital:ClassA:CAO
account Equity:ShareCapital:ClassA:CFO
account Equity:ShareCapital:ClassA:Secretary
; Class B: non-voting common shares (family and friends investors)
account Equity:ShareCapital:ClassB:Investor01
account Equity:ShareCapital:ClassB:Investor02
account Equity:ShareCapital:ClassB:Investor03
account Equity:ShareCapital:ClassB:Investor04
account Equity:ShareCapital:ClassB:Investor05
account Equity:ShareCapital:ClassB:Investor06
account Equity:ShareCapital:ClassB:Investor07
account Equity:ShareCapital:ClassB:Investor08
account Equity:ShareCapital:ClassB:Investor09
account Equity:ShareCapital:ClassB:Investor10
account Equity:RetainedEarnings

